    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051119.0096\n\nMELBOURNE, Nov. 19 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nSchedule of Artistic Gymnastics Worlds\n\n\n\n\nFollowing is the competition schedule of the 2005 Artistic Gymnastics World Championships to kick off here on Tuesday:\nNovember 22: Men's qualifications\n\nNovember 23: Women's qualifications\n\nNovember 24: Men's all-around final\n\nNovember 25: Women's all-around final\n\nNovember 26: Apparatus finals, Men's - Floor, Pommel horse, Rings\n\nWomen's - Vault, Uneven bars\n\nNovember 27: Apparatus finals, Men's - Vault, Parallel bars, Horizontal bars; Women's - Balance beam, Floor",
